      { source: "Fragment 7.23.1", quote: "I have traveled in my youth; I have wandered in search of a book, perhaps the catalogue of catalogues. Now that my eyes can hardly decipher what I write, I am preparing to die just a few leagues from the hexagon in which I was born." },
